Package: llmpublic
Title: Small Utilities for LLM Usage Tracking, Code Analysis and Notes Search
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("John", "Gavin", , "john.b.gavin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A small collection of generic helpers. It parses and
    summarises usage reports from the 'ccusage' command line tool, with
    terminal progress bars and a DuckDB store. It extracts function calls
    and definitions from R source files and builds frequency tables and
    call networks. It builds and queries a full-text (BM25) search index
    over a directory of markdown notes. It generates hover-popup HTML
    spans. Every function takes its paths and data as explicit arguments.
